MODULE: UnreadPartitionRecovered
TARGET: RecoveryEntitled
CLASS: Action
SUMMARY: missing prepares trigger recovery before all partitions have consumed the captured horizon
PERTURBS: Recover

--- FIND
    /\ staged /\ Missing /\ HistoryEntitled /\ sourceDecisionCommitted
    /\ horizonWal = wal /\ AtHorizon
--- REPLACE
    /\ staged /\ Missing /\ HistoryEntitled /\ sourceDecisionCommitted
    /\ horizonWal = wal
--- END
